sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Reader
  participant Unluminous
  participant Disk as The disk
  Reader ->>+ Unluminous: Open notes.md
  Unluminous ->>+ Disk: Read it
  Disk -->>- Unluminous: The bytes
  Note right of Unluminous: nothing is fetched
  loop every keystroke
    Unluminous ->> Unluminous: Lay the preview out
  end
  alt it parsed
    Unluminous -->>- Reader: The drawn page
  else it did not
    Unluminous --x Reader: The line it went wrong on
  end
